watermark_info.description:
Whether to also generate a watermarked result. Configured with `enabled`; custom watermarks are not supported.

```json
"watermark_info": {
  "enabled": false // Whether to generate a watermarked result; true to generate, false not to; defaults to false
}
```

contents.description:
Materials for generation, such as prompts, images, and elements.

The reference format is as follows. See the parameter descriptions below:

```json
"contents": [
  {
    "type": "prompt",
    "text": "string"
  },
  {
    "type": "refer_image",
    "url": "string",
    "id": "string"
  },
  {
    "type": "element",
    "element_id": "string",
    "id": "string"
  }
]
```

- The order of prompts, reference images, and elements is the analysis order

Note: Elements (`element`) are not yet integrated and cannot be used.
